        "section": "watchmaking",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Watchmaking - 03 The Pendulum Revolution",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Immediate accuracy improvement:** From ±15 min/day (verge-foliot) to approximately ±1 min/day. This factor of 15 improvement came entirely from replacing the foliot with a pendulum."
    }
